PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
33-turn game. Bandit built a wide Pengullet/Elphidran Aqua/Relaxaurus/Chillet/Jormuntide board with Pengullet Rocket Launcher buffs, but several attacks were nullified by tinnnierpenguin's Cryolinx/Pyrin Noct/Reindrix/Foxparks interrupts. Bandit's own Pump-Action Shotgun self-damage (1200 to own Pals, turn 22) and Hanging Trap exile play (turns 29-31) added tempo swings. Multiple Chillet-vs-Chillet trades occurred (turns 27-28) along with a Jormuntide Ignis (1700) destroying Bandit's own Jormuntide (1600, turn 28). tinnnierpenguin's Relaxaurus/Cryolinx/Fuack chipped Bandit down (10->8->7->5->2), and Bandit surrendered at 2 life vs tinnnierpenguin's 8.


